<title>LATVIA: C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE THIRD STRAIGHT WEEK.</title>
<headline>C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE THIRD STRAIGHT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's central bank said on Monday that it has set an unchanged rate for its 31-day deposits at 1.5 percent from next week.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that it will accept 31-day deposits at this rate on May 26 and the payment date will be June 26.</p>
<p>The rate for 31-day deposits has remained stable since it was cut from 2.0 percent on May 5.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
